---
<section id="roadmap" class="bg-white" aria-label="Roadmap">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-3">Honest about where we are</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-body leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-16">Somotracker is early. Here is what is live, what we are building with pilot schools, and what comes next.</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 md:gap-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-ink" aria-label="Available now" />
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Available now</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-body leading-relaxed">
          <li>School setup</li>
          <li>Classes</li>
          <li>Timetable and substitutions</li>
          <li>Attendance</li>
          <li>Events and rooms</li>
          <li>Curriculum browser</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-ink/50" aria-label="Building with pilot" />
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Building with pilot schools</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-body leading-relaxed">
          <li>Student profiles and guardian linking</li>
          <li>Bulk student import</li>
          <li>Timetable conflict detection</li>
          <li>Attendance reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border-2 border-ink bg-transparent" aria-label="Next" />
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Next, shaped by your feedback</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-body leading-relaxed">
          <li>CBC assessments and report cards</li>
          <li>Fee tracking and M-Pesa</li>
          <li>Parent SMS and WhatsApp updates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-6">[BUILD NOTE: only keep a feature in "Building" if it will ship by Term 1 2027; otherwise move it right.]</p>
  </div>
</section>
